        "original_id": "2330595d-888f-504e-9af0-e937f8cdf3e3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Original Soundtrack, \"I'm Not in Love\", Relayted, Affiliyated\n- People: Eric Stewart, Graham Gouldman\n- Organizations: 10cc, Gayngs, Doomtree\n- Concepts: singles, remix EP, song inspiration, tempo\n\nFacts:\n- \"I'm Not in Love\" is a song by the English group 10cc that was written by band members Eric Stewart and Graham Gouldman.\n- The Original Soundtrack includes the singles \"Life Is a Minestrone\" and \"I'm Not in Love\".\n- \"I'm Not in Love\" was 10cc's most popular song.\n- Relayted was inspired by 10cc's \"I'm Not in Love\".\n- Every song on Relayted was recorded at 69 BPM.\n- Affiliyated is a remix EP by Doomtree of Gayngs' 2010 debut album Relayted.",
